 telah didustakan Musa, lalu Aku tangguhkan (azab-Ku) untuk orang-orang kafir, kemudian Aku azab mereka, maka (lihatlah) bagaimana besarnya kebencian-Ku (kepada mereka itu).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَصْحَٰبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَدْيَنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكُذِّبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَمْلَيْتُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4a0c07aeb42f1f106125.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa sam dao vremena", "en": "so I granted respite", "tr": "böylece mühlet verdim", "fr": "alors J'ai accordé un délai", "id": "maka aku memberi tangguh", "ur": "پھر میں نے ڈھیل دی", "bn": "তখন আমি অবকাশ দিলাম", "fa": "پس مهلت دادم"}}, {"text": "لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَخَذْتُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَكَيْفَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَانَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَكِيرِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:183", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1137.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "I give them rein (for) lo! My scheme is strong.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ayrıca ben onlara mühlet de veririm. Fakat benim tuzak kurup helâk edişim pek çetindir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور میں انہیں ڈھیل دوں گا بیشک میری خفیہ تدبیر بہت پکی ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Aku memberi tangguh kepada mereka. Sesungguhnya rencana-Ku amat teguh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": 